                <pb facs="0075" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v26/pg47"/>

                <head>31. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On December 18, President Eisenhower sent Vice President Nixon as his personal
                    representative to Austria for first-hand information about the Hungarian refugee
                    situation. Regarding the Vice President’s visit, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1955-57v25/pg_534">volume XXV, pages 534</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus:frus1955-57v25/pg_539">539</ref>.</p>
            </div>
